  Right now ---------------------------------------- in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer
    Signed in as   work (you@work.example)
    Why this one   chosen for C:\Projects and the folders inside it
    Other folders  your usual Claude Code sign-in (you@personal.example)
  Change the account -------------------
    Use another account here           >
    Use another account everywhere     >
| > Use another account just once      >
    Forget this folder's choice        >
  Sign in ------------------------------
    Sign in again                      >
    Sign in with another account       >
  Claude Code setup --------------------
    Bring your Claude Code setup over  >
  Manage -------------------------------
    Rename or remove an account        >
  Use another account just once ----------------------------------------------
  Run one command with another account. Nothing is saved and nothing else
  changes. You pick an account and get the command to run.
[keys] ↑↓ move  ·  enter open  ·  v check who is signed in
